!CME_OPT1_Hard_Negative_Augmentation/reports/*.json
!CME_OPT1_Hard_Negative_Augmentation/reports/before/*.json
!CME_OPT1_Hard_Negative_Augmentation/reports/after/*.json

# CME-OPT2: measured reports only, no datasets, credentials or checkpoints
